{{also|zink}}
==English==

===Etymology===
* As a {{der|en|de|-}} surname, from an obsolete derivative of {{der|en|gem-pro|*tindaz|t=peak, spike, tooth}}.
* As a surname derived from various Romance languages, from {{m|en|Jacinctus}}, derived from the saint's name {{m|en|Hyacinthus}}. Comparable to {{cog|es|Jacinto}}, {{cog|it|Giacinto}}.

